---
import ReviewLayout from '../../../layouts/ReviewLayout.astro';
---

<ReviewLayout
  title="Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-42 R7 7445HS"
  harga="Rp 17.000.000 – 18.000.000"
  rating={4.3}
  kategori="Gaming"
  tanggal="5 Juni 2025"
  ringkasan="Acer Nitro V15 ANV15-42 — R7 7445HS + RTX 4050 ±60W TGP, layar FHD 180Hz 100% sRGB, cooling 2 fan 3 heatpipe, garansi 2Y Part/3Y Svc + 1Y ADP."
>

  <h2>Spesifikasi</h2>
  <table class="spek-table">
    <tr><td>CPU</td><td>AMD Ryzen 7 7445HS</td></tr>
    <tr><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA RTX 4050 — TGP ±60W / 75W</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Layar</td><td>15.6" FHD (1920×1080) IPS, 180Hz, 100% sRGB</td></tr>
    <tr><td>RAM</td><td>16GB DDR5 SO-DIMM (Upgradeable)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Upgrade</td><td>RAM Only (slot SO-DIMM tersedia)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Baterai / Charger</td><td>59Wh / 135W</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Cooling</td><td>2 Fan, 3 Heatpipe</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Bobot</td><td>±2.1 kg</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Garansi</td><td>2Y Part · 3Y Servis · 1Y ADP</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Merk</td><td>Acer</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Harga</td><td>Rp 17.000.000 – 18.000.000</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>Benchmark CPU: AMD Ryzen 7 7445HS</h2>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px 32px;margin-bottom:16px;">
    <div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;">
        <span style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#374151;">Single-Core Performance</span>
        <span style="font-weight:700;background:#e5e7eb;color:#374151;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.85rem;border:1px solid #d1d5db;">67</span>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#e5e7eb;border-radius:4px;height:6px;"><div style="background:#1e3a8a;height:6px;border-radius:4px;width:67%;"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;">
        <span style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#374151;">Multi-Core Performance</span>
        <span style="font-weight:700;background:#e5e7eb;color:#374151;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.85rem;border:1px solid #d1d5db;">28</span>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#e5e7eb;border-radius:4px;height:6px;"><div style="background:#1e3a8a;height:6px;border-radius:4px;width:28%;"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;">
        <span style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#374151;">Power Efficiency</span>
        <span style="font-weight:700;background:#e5e7eb;color:#374151;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.85rem;border:1px solid #d1d5db;">72</span>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#e5e7eb;border-radius:4px;height:6px;"><div style="background:#1e3a8a;height:6px;border-radius:4px;width:72%;"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;">
        <span style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#374151;">Integrated Graphics</span>
        <span style="font-weight:700;background:#e5e7eb;color:#374151;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.85rem;border:1px solid #d1d5db;">43</span>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#e5e7eb;border-radius:4px;height:6px;"><div style="background:#1e3a8a;height:6px;border-radius:4px;width:43%;"></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;">
      <span style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#374151;">NanoReview Final Score</span>
      <span style="font-weight:700;background:#1e40af;color:white;padding:2px 14px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.85rem;">52</span>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#e5e7eb;border-radius:4px;height:6px;"><div style="background:#1e3a8a;height:6px;border-radius:4px;width:52%;"></div></div>
  </div>
  <table class="spek-table">
    <tr><td>Passmark Single-Thread</td><td>3.488</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Passmark Multi-Thread</td><td>18.718</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:8px;">Sumber: NanoReview · PassMark</p>

  <h2>RTX 4050 Ada Lovelace — Efisiensi Lebih Baik</h2>
  <p>
    RTX 4050 berbasis arsitektur Ada Lovelace dengan efisiensi daya lebih baik dari RTX 3050, dan dukungan
    DLSS 3 Frame Generation. Di TGP ±60W, performanya kompetitif untuk gaming 1080p medium-high settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Ryzen 7 7445HS — CPU Kencang</h2>
  <p>
    8 core dengan TDP hingga 54W. Single-core kuat untuk gaming, multi-core memadai untuk streaming ringan.
    Kombinasi dengan RTX 4050 memberi keseimbangan performa tanpa bottleneck.
  </p>

  <h2>Kelebihan & Kekurangan</h2>
  <div class="pros-cons">
    <div class="pros">
      <h3>✅ Kelebihan</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>R7 7445HS CPU AMD kencang</li>
        <li>RTX 4050 Ada Lovelace — arsitektur lebih baru dari RTX 3050</li>
        <li>Layar 180Hz 100% sRGB</li>
        <li>DDR5 (lebih cepat dari DDR4)</li>
        <li>Garansi 2Y/3Y + 1Y ADP</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="cons">
      <h3>❌ Kekurangan</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>RAM DDR5 upgradeable (sudah 16GB)</li>
        <li>Baterai 59Wh lebih kecil dari varian RTX 5050 (76Wh)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Kesimpulan</h2>
  <p>
    Nitro V15 ANV15-42 cocok untuk yang prioritasnya CPU AMD kencang + GPU generasi Ada Lovelace.
    Pilih varian ini kalau lebih sering multitasking atau streaming sambil gaming.
    Kalau prioritas GPU terbaru + baterai besar, lihat varian RTX 5050.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Direkomendasikan untuk:</strong> Gamer yang mau platform AMD + RTX 4050 di 17–18 juta.
  </p>

</ReviewLayout>
